        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Data Envelopment Analysis at Fifty: From efficiency measurement to intelligent data-enabled analytics and decision making]]></title>
            <link>https://kerostig.org/call/elsevier-omega-55th-anniversary-special-issue-data-envelopment-analysis-at-fifty-from-efficiency-measurement-to-intelligent-data-enabled-analytics-and-decision-making/</link>
            <guid>elsevier-omega-55th-anniversary-special-issue-data-envelopment-analysis-at-fifty-from-efficiency-measurement-to-intelligent-data-enabled-analytics-and-decision-making</guid>
            <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:27:21 GMT</pubDate>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[
<div>
    
    
    
    <p>This special issue celebrates the 55th anniversary of Omega journal and marks fifty years since the introduction of Data Envelopment Analysis (DEA). The special issue seeks to showcase the evolution of DEA from its origins as a tool for efficiency measurement to its current applications in intelligent data-enabled analytics and decision making.</p>
    
    <p>
        Appel publié par Omega.
        
        <a href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/special-issue/335920/omega-55th-anniversary-special-issue-data-envelopment-analysis-at-fifty-from-efficiency-measurement-to-intelligent-data-enabled-analytics-and-decision-making">Voir l'appel sur le site de l'éditeur</a>.
        
        <a href="https://kerostig.org/call/elsevier-omega-55th-anniversary-special-issue-data-envelopment-analysis-at-fifty-from-efficiency-measurement-to-intelligent-data-enabled-analytics-and-decision-making/">Fiche de l'appel sur kerostig</a>.
    </p>
    
    
    <h2>Timeline</h2>
    <ul>
        
        <li>May 31, 2027: Submission deadline</li>
        
    </ul>
    
    
</div>
]]></content:encoded>
